{"id":"composer_000015","name":"贝拉·巴托克","originalName":"Bartók Béla","aliases":["巴托克","贝拉·巴尔托克","Béla Bartók","Bela Bartok","Bartok"],"birthYear":1881,"deathYear":1945,"nationality":"匈牙利","period":"20世纪","introduction":"匈牙利作曲家、钢琴家与民族音乐学奠基人之一。他与柯达伊系统采集匈牙利及东欧民间音乐，把农民歌曲的五声性节奏与音程融入现代作曲技法，形成尖锐而鲜活的个人语言。代表作有六首弦乐四重奏、《乐队协奏曲》、《神奇的满大人》与《为两个孩子写的钢琴小曲》。","styleSummary":"民间旋律与现代和声的结合，节奏强劲不对称，夜曲式的神秘音响与粗犷舞曲并置。","completeness":"complete","status":"published","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T12:00:00.000Z","sources":[{"id":"wikipedia-en-bela-bartok","title":"Béla Bartók","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/B%C3%A9la_Bart%C3%B3k","publisher":"English Wikipedia","accessedAt":"2026-08-27","supports":["name","birthYear","deathYear","nationality","period","introduction"]}],"works":[{"id":"work_000039","composerId":"composer_000015","composerName":"贝拉·巴托克","title":"乐队协奏曲","originalTitle":"Concerto for Orchestra, Sz. 116, BB 123","opus":"Sz. 116 / BB 123","genre":"乐队协奏曲","periodKey":"twentieth","genreFamily":"concerto","durationMinutes":37,"difficulty":"容易进入","tags":["巴托克","乐队协奏曲","20世纪","匈牙利","美国时期"],"summary":"巴托克1943年受库谢维茨基基金会委约、在纽约州疗养期间写成，让乐队各声部轮番像独奏家一样出场，是他最受欢迎的管弦乐作品。","upcomingEventIds":["perf_4dfa333e30a481c2","perf_16df5ef2c7df1877"],"upcomingEventCount":2}],"upcomingEventIds":["perf_4dfa333e30a481c2","perf_16df5ef2c7df1877"],"upcomingEventCount":2}